fonts-shippori-mincho (0~git20260930.9710da1-1~smallgearlab1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging of Shippori Mincho (FONTDASU), the five weights of the
    Google Fonts repository at commit 9710da1 (2026-09-30), unmodified.
  * Ubuntu has no package for it. fonts-craft depends on this one, for the
    fonts that PhotoCraft's own font set (storytold/craft-fonts) names.

